  "body": "ASTERION REACH\nTHE STARS REMEMBER\n◈\n467+87\nCREDITS\n◇\n135+42\nMINERALS\n✧\n0+57\nSCIENCE\n⌘\n10 / 10\nORDERS\nРусский\nGalaxy\nResearch\nDiplomacy\nEmpire\nChronicle\nHome\n⌂Solace\nCONCORD\n⌂Veyr Prime\nVEYR\n⌂Kharos\nKHAR\n⌂Lumen\nCHOIR\nMeridian\nVOLCANIC\nHesper\nBARREN\nAurelia\nVOLCANIC\nCaldera\nGLACIAL\nVelorum\nGLACIAL\nAshfall\nKHAR\nCarina\nVEYR\nEidolon\nOCEAN\nSable\nGLACIAL\nIlyra\nKHAR\nKepler\nGLACIAL\nStillwater\nTERRAN\nOrison\nGLACIAL\nCinder\nOCEAN\nBellatrix\nGLACIAL\nSundrift\nGLACIAL\nThalassa\nCHOIR\nOphion\nARID\nTethys\nKHAR\nCorvus\nCHOIR\nElysian\nCHOIR\nAster\nVEYR\nNyx\nGLACIAL\nHaven\nTERRAN\nAldebaran\nARID\nCaelum\nKHAR\nVesper\nKHAR\nIona\nVOLCANIC\nHalcyon\nCONCORD\nAntares\nCONCORD\nSeraph\nBARREN\nPeregrine\nARID\nMorrow\nTERRAN\nZenith\nVOLCANIC\nEos\nVOLCANIC\nTerminus\nUNSURVEYED\nAsterion\nCONCORD\n△\n▴\n▴\n⬡\nTHE ASTERION REACH\nTHE UNCHARTED EXPANSE\nCONCORD EXPLORATION AUTHORITY\nThe Asterion Reach\n\n41 charted systems · 37 surveyed · seed ASTERION\n\n+\n−\n⌖\nA CIVILIZATION TAKES SHAPE\n4 worlds share your future. Develop your economy, meet the frontier powers, and choose your path to victory.\nPER ASPERA, AD ASTRA\nCONCORD\nCHARTED\nUNKNOWN\n⌂ FOUNDING WORLD\nDORMANT LANE\nA galaxy of possibilities.\n\nSelect a fleet in orbit to explore the frontier.\n\nFleet roster →\nTHE CONCORD\nSolace\n\nTerran world · Founding system\n\nTemperate oceans and broad continental shelves.\n\n90%\nHABITABILITY\n12/12\nPOPULATION\n29\nPRODUCTION\nCOLONY PRODUCTION\n29 / CYCLE\n\nYour construction teams await a new project.\n\n+ Commission a project\nINFRASTRUCTURE\n5 / 5 SLOTS\n◇ Orbital Extractor\n⌁ Orbital Shipyard\n✧ Research Enclave\n◎ Habitation Domes\n▥ Manufactory\n\nAll slots occupied. Replace infrastructure or grow the colony.\n\n▥\nForge Charter I\n\nA specialized colonial economy.\n\nManage →\n\n+7 production · +2 orbital repair · +10% military mineral saving\n\n+27 credits · +12 minerals · +19 science\n\nFOUNDING WORLD\n⌂\n\nA permanent Domination objective. Holding all four founding worlds wins the campaign.\n\nFounded by\nConcord\nCurrent control\nConcord\n\nMoving an administrative capital does not move this objective.\n\nIN ORBIT\n1 FLEET\nColony Ark 31\nColony ship · 24 / 24 hull\nReady\n1 jump\nORBITAL MAINTENANCE\n10 HULL / CYCLE\n\nAll your fleets here are fully repaired.\n\nShips at one colony share its repair capacity. Splitting or merging does not increase the total.\nCONNECTED SYSTEMS\nSundrift ↗\nAntares ↗\nCycle 27\n2426 CE\nEND CYCLE →\n↶ Undo\n10 orders remaining · 4 colonies\nCycle 27: 1 dispatches available in your briefing.\nASTERION REACH / EARLY ACCESS 0.23.0\n● AUTOSAVED\nTurn 27: a new mandate begins.",
  "inspector": "THE CONCORD\nSolace\n\nTerran world · Founding system\n\nTemperate oceans and broad continental shelves.\n\n90%\nHABITABILITY\n12/12\nPOPULATION\n29\nPRODUCTION\nCOLONY PRODUCTION\n29 / CYCLE\n\nYour construction teams await a new project.\n\n+ Commission a project\nINFRASTRUCTURE\n5 / 5 SLOTS\n◇ Orbital Extractor\n⌁ Orbital Shipyard\n✧ Research Enclave\n◎ Habitation Domes\n▥ Manufactory\n\nAll slots occupied. Replace infrastructure or grow the colony.\n\n▥\nForge Charter I\n\nA specialized colonial economy.\n\nManage →\n\n+7 production · +2 orbital repair · +10% military mineral saving\n\n+27 credits · +12 minerals · +19 science\n\nFOUNDING WORLD\n⌂\n\nA permanent Domination objective. Holding all four founding worlds wins the campaign.\n\nFounded by\nConcord\nCurrent control\nConcord\n\nMoving an administrative capital does not move this objective.\n\nIN ORBIT\n1 FLEET\nColony Ark 31\nColony ship · 24 / 24 hull\nReady\n1 jump\nORBITAL MAINTENANCE\n10 HULL / CYCLE\n\nAll your fleets here are fully repaired.\n\nShips at one colony share its repair capacity. Splitting or merging does not increase the total.\nCONNECTED SYSTEMS\nSundrift ↗\nAntares ↗",
